silm:instances_papers_04_forge_sections_09_manifest_hom_profile_concrete_anchor_4 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 09_manifest_hom_profile #4', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'Manifest as Written Hom-Profile' the bare symbol Shapes anchors to VetRecordAboutMittens: The vet-record file Dr. Osei filled out during Mittens' 2024-03-15 check-up: a physical document carrying body mass (4.2 kg), age, and clinical notes — the raw packet before any Forge handling.." .
